$\tag{$*$}
\sum_{k=0}^{pq-1} (-1)^{\lfloor \frac{k}{p} \rfloor
+ \lfloor \frac{k}{q} \rfloor} =
\begin{cases}
0 & \text{if } pq \text{ is even,} \\
1 & \text{if } pq \text{ is odd.}
\end{cases}$
(Here $\lfloor x \rfloor$ denotes the integer part of $x$.)

